 "notes": "PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: prompt says rules on BOTH the new and existing security-group paths may use a managed prefix list ID, but the GT only declares prefix-list rule resources for the new-SG path (existing-SG path supports CIDR and referenced-SG rules only); the prefix-list check is therefore not tied to a specific path. Not expressible: which declared rule resources target the existing (input) SG vs the created SG, the 'exactly one of' rule-target constraint (variable validation), and the prefix-list gate conditions."
